{"id":"manera","lemma":"manera","pos":"noun","rank":224,"glosses":["way; manner; method; style"],"ipa":"/maˈneɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"maneras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-manera.wav","formAudio":{"maneras":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-maneras.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿No te sientes de alguna manera responsable?","en":"Don't you feel in some way responsible?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688947","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,{"g":"responsible"}]},{"text":"¿Esas son maneras de hablar con tu profesor?","en":"Is that any way to talk to your teacher?","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"professor"}]},{"text":"Me sentí de la misma manera.","en":"I felt the same way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450604","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},null,null,{"g":"same","l":"mismo"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Intenta verlo a mi manera.","en":"Try to see it my way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611264","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"intentar"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"De todas maneras iremos.","en":"In any case, we'll go.","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]}]}